<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>Hello <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>
  A password reset was requested for your account. This link expires in 15 minutes
  and can be used only once.
</p>

<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", @reset_url %></p>

<p>If you did not request this, you can ignore this email.</p>
